{"alias":"/cds/contact","title":"CDS Regional Site Contact Info","changed":"2026-08-17T14:13:53+00:00","before":"<p>The nine regional CDS sites serve the various geographical regions of Maine.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6 py-2\">\r\n<div class=\"card h-100\">\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>Early Intervention (Under Age 3)</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<p>For children under three years of age, <a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Early%20Intervention%20for%20ME%20-%20Town%20Lookup%20-%207.23.2024.xlsx\">find the regional site serving the town in which the child lives</a>, or call the State IEU at 877-770-8883.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6 py-2\">\r\n<div class=\"card h-100\">\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>Part B (Ages 3 to 5)</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<p>For children 3 to 5 years old, <a href=\"https://maine.maps.arcgis.com/apps/mapviewer/index.html?webmap=3c26622da72f4238a0d95bb8059914e5\">find the regional site serving the town in which the child lives</a>.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a class=\"btn btn-info btn-lg btn-block file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"e1ca6317-96db-4c4e-b628-c53f5ed59f1c\" filename=\"CDS - Part B Site and SAU Lookup - 8.17.2026.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/CDS%20-%20Part%20B%20Site%20and%20SAU%20Lookup%20-%208.17.2026.pdf\">Part B SAU &amp; Site Lookup</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"blockhead\">\r\n<h2>Regional CDS Site Directory</h2>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6 py-2\">\r\n<div class=\"card h-100\">\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>CDS Aroostook</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<p>985 Skyway Drive<br />\r\n